@startuml
skinparam style strictuml
monochrome true
title Laboratorio 01 - Paso 2: SOLID (SRP & OCP) - Centro de Control de Tráfico

interface ITollStrategy {
    + calculateFee(vehicleType : String) : double
}

class StandardToll implements ITollStrategy {
    + calculateFee(vehicleType : String) : double
}

class DynamicToll implements ITollStrategy {
    + calculateFee(vehicleType : String) : double
}

class TrafficControlCenter {
    - strategy : ITollStrategy
    + TrafficControlCenter(strategy : ITollStrategy)
    + setStrategy(strategy : ITollStrategy) : void
    + processToll(vehicle : String) : double
}

TrafficControlCenter o-> "1" ITollStrategy : usa / delega

note top of ITollStrategy
  Patrón Strategy (OCP):
  Cerrado a la modificación,
  abierto a la extensión sin switch-cases.
end note

note bottom of TrafficControlCenter
  SRP: Solo orquesta el tráfico,
  no calcula fórmulas de peaje.
end note

@enduml
